OL,3,GNEWSAThree murder arrests over man's
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men and a woman have been arrested
OL,7,Fon suspicion of murdering a 51-year-old
OL,8,Fman who was stabbed to death.
OL,10,FDean Fishwick, from Peterlee, died in
OL,11,Fhospital shortly after being found
OL,12,Finjured at a property on Thames Road in
OL,13,Fthe town shortly before midnight on
OL,14,FWednesday.
OL,16,FOne of the arrested men, aged 53, and
OL,17,Fthe 73-year-old woman remained in
OL,18,Fcustody for questioning on Friday,
OL,19,FDurham Police said.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
